<tr>
<td><div class="thumb tright"><div class="thumbinner" style="width:302px;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Titlebar%20components.png"><img alt="" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/Wiki/assets/mw/images/6/6e/Titlebar_components.png" width="300" height="105" class="thumbimage" srcset="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/Wiki/assets/mw/images/6/6e/Titlebar_components.png 1.5x, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/Wiki/assets/mw/images/6/6e/Titlebar_components.png 2x" /></a>  <div class="thumbcaption"><div class="magnify"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20Titlebar%20components.png" title="Enlarge"></a></div>How to determine which module is currently open</div></div></div>
